window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>If you run from love, you're asking for a chase.... </p> <p>James Brock lived without the woman he loves for the past 10 years. Using his job as head of the Federal Paranormal Unit to help others, he's done a good job of ignoring his lack of a personal life, until she returns. His salvation. His first love. </p> <p>Cynthia Vega had a very good reason to leave the only man she loved after she'd accepted his marriage proposal. Now she's back as his boss. And he's not willing to ignore their chemistry or the past. </p> <p>Brock is determined to claim his mate and prove that their passion is even hotter than before. He wants her and her explanation for their separation. Except, some secrets won't stay buried in the past. Brock will fight his demons to follow her lead, but Cynthia's reluctance to explain their lost love may be the one key to their destruction.... </p> <p>Mature listener warning: This book contains and is not limited to: violence, raw sexual language, and actions. It is intended for listeners 18 and older. </p>"; 
